  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Social Protection in the Pacific (P4SP) 2020-2021 to 2029-2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Social Protection supports Pacific Island Countries (PICs) to establish and strengthen their social protection systems, with an emphasis on building effective, sustainable, gender-responsive and shock responsive social protection systems. The P4SP initiative provides catalytic technical assistance to establish and improve Pacific island social protection systems to reach the most vulnerable, and will lay the foundations for systems that make countries more resilient to future crises.</narrative>
  </description>
